---
import LeadBot from './LeadBot.astro';
---

<section class="bg-(--color-bg-surface) py-20 md:py-28 border-y border-(--color-bg-hover)">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">

    <!-- Header centrado -->
    <div class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16 reveal-up">
      <p class="text-(--color-accent) text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-3">Asistente Virtual · Sin costo</p>
      <h2 class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-(--color-text-primary) mb-4 leading-tight">
        Cuéntanos tu caso.<br/>
        <span class="text-gradient-gold">Te orientamos en minutos.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-(--color-text-secondary) max-w-xl mx-auto text-base md:text-lg">
        Nuestro asistente te hará unas preguntas breves para entender tu situación y conectarte con la abogada indicada para tu caso. Sin compromiso.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">

      <!-- Izquierda: trust signals -->
      <div class="reveal-left">
        <div class="space-y-5">

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 group">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-[#C3A75D]/10 border border-[#C3A75D]/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-[#C3A75D]/18 transition-colors duration-300">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-(--color-accent)" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-(--color-text-primary) font-semibold text-sm mb-0.5">Sin costo, sin compromiso</p>
              <p class="text-(--color-text-secondary) text-sm leading-relaxed">La primera orientación es gratuita. Solo pagas si decides continuar con una defensa formal.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 group">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-[#C3A75D]/10 border border-[#C3A75D]/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-[#C3A75D]/18 transition-colors duration-300">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-(--color-accent)" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-(--color-text-primary) font-semibold text-sm mb-0.5">Respuesta en menos de 24 hrs</p>
              <p class="text-(--color-text-secondary) text-sm leading-relaxed">Una abogada revisará tu caso y te contactará por WhatsApp con orientación inicial.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 group">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-[#C3A75D]/10 border border-[#C3A75D]/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-[#C3A75D]/18 transition-colors duration-300">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-(--color-accent)" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-(--color-text-primary) font-semibold text-sm mb-0.5">Conectamos con la abogada correcta</p>
              <p class="text-(--color-text-secondary) text-sm leading-relaxed">Según tu área (laboral, familiar o civil), te asignamos quien tiene la especialización exacta.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 group">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-[#C3A75D]/10 border border-[#C3A75D]/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-[#C3A75D]/18 transition-colors duration-300">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-(--color-accent)" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-(--color-text-primary) font-semibold text-sm mb-0.5">100% confidencial</p>
              <p class="text-(--color-text-secondary) text-sm leading-relaxed">Tu información y situación son privadas. Solo la abogada asignada tendrá acceso a tu caso.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Separador dorado -->
        <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-(--color-bg-hover)">
          <p class="text-(--color-text-muted) text-xs">
            ¿Prefieres el teléfono?
            <a href="https://wa.me/56995630415" class="text-(--color-accent) hover:text-[#E2C98A] transition-colors font-medium">
              Escríbenos por WhatsApp →
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Derecha: LeadBot -->
      <div class="reveal-right">
        <LeadBot />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
